{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46781","headline":"寄黄晖处士 · 齐己","name":"寄黄晖处士","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"蒙氏艺传黄氏子，独闻相继得名高。\n锋鋩妙夺金鸡距，纤利精分玉兔毫。\n濡染只应亲赋咏，风流不称近方刀。\n何妨寄我临池兴，忍使江淹役梦劳。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"齐己","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46781.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46781","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}